  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fmanage%252faff.php%253faff%253d372\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8dNQkxR.png\" alt=\"通用锯木机模组\" width=\"1217\" height=\"800\"></a></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/discord.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"Supplementaries Discord\" width=\"163\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/patreon.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我\" width=\"180\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://badges.penpow.dev/badges/social/twitter-plural/cozy.svg\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\" width=\"189\" height=\"55\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/youtube.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"YouTube频道\" width=\"183\" height=\"50\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9pyh4RH.png\" width=\"1519\" height=\"37\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>📖 关于本模组 📖</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">通用锯木机专注做好一件事。<br>本模组新增了一个锯木机工作站，可制作所有木制品。<br>功能完美融入世界生成，包含独特的村民房屋和木匠职业，提供无缝体验。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">主要特性：</span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">锯木机配方<strong>兼容所有模组</strong>，可制作任何木材衍生方块</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>木匠村民</strong>可在锯木机工作</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">数据驱动的木匠交易</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">木匠附带<strong>5种独特房屋</strong>，完美契合原版村庄风格</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">锯木机工作站配有专属<strong>锯木音效</strong><br></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">集成KubeJs支持自定义配方（也可使用数据包）</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">基于Moonlight系统的村民交易数据驱动</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">不添加冗余木制方块，仅保留核心锯木机</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">兼容Repurposed Structures模组</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">模组制作者可启用<em>save_recipes</em>配置将动态配方转为静态JSON文件</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/otkWqcPNu2A?si=fUhw7QOWF125LxYl\" height=\"314\" width=\"560\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9pyh4RH.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🏆 鸣谢 🏆</strong></span></p><blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Plantkillable - 所有纹理设计</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Raspmary - 锯木音效</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Zapsplat.org - 原始锯木音效</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">AlleCraft - 战利品表</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Artkek - 部分建筑结构</span></li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9pyh4RH.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❤️ 支持作者 ❤️</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">模组开发耗费大量时间，若您喜欢我的作品，可通过以下方式支持。支持者将获得定制<strong>地球仪</strong>或<strong>雕像</strong>！使用Akliz服务器时输入\"supplementaries\"优惠码亦可获得同等支持。</span></p><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/mehvahdjukaar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sroRu1I.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"346\" height=\"68\"></a></p><div style=\"text-align:left\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">需要服务器？Akliz提供专业模组服务器托管服务。</span></div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">他们拥有优质社区与技术支持，使用优惠码\"supplementaries\"可享<strong>8折优惠</strong>，同时支持我的开发工作！</span><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fsupplementaries\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g5B76A8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"150\"></a>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9pyh4RH.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🦉 我们的模组 🦉</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/haunted-harvest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/769/890/638107786158633425.gif\" alt=\"Haunted Harvest\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/s